1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,075
Black Cat, Tan Cat
黑猫，棕猫

2
00:00:03,463 --> 00:00:04,714
Look at Black Cat
看看黑猫

3
00:00:04,984 --> 00:00:06,195
He's on his mat
他在他的垫子上

4
00:00:06,623 --> 00:00:09,195
He's happy, fat, and glad
他快乐，肥胖，快乐

5
00:00:09,304 --> 00:00:12,955
Tan Cat walks by his tail held high
棕猫高高地拖着尾巴走路

6
00:00:13,423 --> 00:00:16,515
And now Black Cat is mad
现在黑猫生气了

7
00:00:16,984 --> 00:00:20,515
He thinks Tan Cat  wants on his mat
他认为谭猫想上他的垫子

8
00:00:20,864 --> 00:00:22,914
Black Cat will never share
黑猫永远不会分享

9
00:00:23,224 --> 00:00:24,515
It is so sad
这太可悲了

10
00:00:24,864 --> 00:00:26,754
Tan Cat feels bad
谭猫感觉不好

11
00:00:26,824 --> 00:00:28,161
They could have been a pair
他们可能是一对

